Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.77,0:00:04.48,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,So they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.73,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:10.07,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,The humans who were captured by the \Ndemon king as slaves and their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.65,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,The demon king is known to be\N ruthlessly coldhearted and cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:17.49,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Who knows what kind of horrible \Ntorture they're suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:18.50,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:22.12,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,All the more reason \Nwe must help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:26.25,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Leave it all to me, Merryna!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:30.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.01,Default,CHILD E,0,0,0,,Oh, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:35.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's play, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.47,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.65,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,What should we play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:42.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:47.24,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's play at the park \Nthe grownups made for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:49.02,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,Okay, it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:24.49,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SANTA IS HANDING OUT TOO MANY PRESENTS!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:24.06,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"Santa Is Handing Out Too Many Presents!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:30.69,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"LET'S PLAY, LA, LA, LA"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: TAKERU TAKEMIYA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:34.46,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Experts at playing, gather around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:37.84,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Gather all your hands to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:44.31,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Where are we? This is everyone's park
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:50.94,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Whoosh, whoosh, we\N become the wind on this slide
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:57.48,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Swing, swing, we're flying through\N the air on these swings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:02.47,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,La, la, la-la-la
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:05.74,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,La, la, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:12.29,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's so fun if we all play together
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:15.56,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,La, la, la-la-la
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:18.88,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,La, la, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:25.51,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's all play again tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:47.34,Default,CHILD E,0,0,0,,Yeah. Santa shows up on Christmas \Nnight after we all fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:49.66,Default,CHILD D,0,0,0,,They leave all the good kids
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.02,Default,CHILD D,0,0,0,,something they wanted as \Na gift at their pillows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:55.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! That's amazing! So when's Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:57.21,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,It's actually today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So Santa Claus is coming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:07.38,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,You have to write down your name and \Nwhat you want on paper so Santa knows
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:08.54,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,or they won't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:09.69,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:13.44,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,we don't have any paper here \Nor anything to write with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:18.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay! Leave it to Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:20.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's why you came to \Nget a pen and some paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:25.24,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! Sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What do you think about \Nthis, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.67,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let her be, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:38.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There's no harm in giving \Nthe slaves pen and paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:39.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:44.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You mustn't underestimate what \Npen and paper can be used for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,As you can see, it can \Nbe used as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:56.27,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.65,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:01.17,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Here, use this instead. \NThey're much softer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:05.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:08.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Santa Claus! Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:11.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Just look at how much she's \Nlooking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to tell her no now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.60,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:19.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I've heard of this Santa character.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:21.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,According to the legends...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:27.05,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,They apparently have the power \Nto materialize any wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:27.93,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:31.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There's no way such a great being exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:35.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If they did, we demons would've \Nbeen destroyed ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:36.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If such a great being actually exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:44.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,then they will prove to \Nbe a great asset to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:47.20,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Why, yes... hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:48.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:51.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We shall capture this Santa Claus and \Nmake them His Majesty's subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:52.28,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is the Capture Santa Trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:57.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, please allow me to explain this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:06.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,According to our intel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Santa comes by at night \Nafter everyone is asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:12.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup, yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:16.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,First, let us head to the \Nmines and hide in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:20.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And once everyone is asleep, we \Nshall use transparency magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,completely conceal ourselves, \Nand await Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:29.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Santa will arrive, being none the wiser,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:33.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and then His Majesty will entrap them in \Na binding barrier so they cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.62,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm participating in this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:38.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then Lady Doux will immobilize \Nthem with her ice magic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:40.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and our mission will be complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What do you think of \Nthis plan, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Er, what do I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:51.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So excited! So excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:53.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So excited! So excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.23,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's a brilliant plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:57.15,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:57.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:02.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, let us have those human \Nchildren write letters immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,to lure Santa in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:08.48,italics,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm certain Santa doesn't exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.49,italics,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but this is so endearing that \NI'll just watch over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:14.78,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,Thanks, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Do you think Santa Claus will come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:19.93,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,Yeah, they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.89,Default,CHILD E,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask for cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.29,Default,CHILD D,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask for toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So many wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.05,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,What are you going to ask for, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:29.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:31.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:50.75,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:01.34,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,The prank was a huge success...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:20.39,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Where are the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:24.14,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,How could you get lost in \Nthe demon king's castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.36,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Well, you said to go this way, Tontt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.06,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:30.48,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,We'll be in trouble if the demons wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:35.85,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. Those who hear Santa's \Nbell won't wake up for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:39.63,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,You say that but your non-existent \Nboobs are shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:45.25,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,How about I feed you \Nto one of these demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Caught you, Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.40,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.72,Default,MERRNYA,0,0,0,,A-A child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Everyone else fell asleep, \Nso I came all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.51,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Wh-What?! Who is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm Doux! Doux the demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:02.98,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,A-A demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:05.14,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.65,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,I thought any creature other than
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:09.83,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Santa was supposed to sleep \Nwhen they heard this sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:11.89,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Why are you awake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:15.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux stayed up late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.91,Default,MERRY,0,0,0,,Aw, what a naughty little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.29,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is a bad girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:23.21,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Santa's been won over by a demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.21,0:09:26.14,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you really Santa Claus, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.86,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Yes, I really am Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.40,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,And this is Tontt the gnome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tontt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.73,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,I know, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:38.07,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,We have to hand out some presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.31,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Do you know where the children are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:41.51,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:45.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I do! Doux wants to hand them out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.01,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.45,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,There's something very wrong with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:52.37,Default,MERRNY,0,0,0,,Can you take this one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.37,0:09:53.28,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:57.03,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,You're having a demon help \Nyou hand out presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:58.75,Default,DOUX/MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.14,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Doux is a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.71,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,She's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:05.73,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,She might just be getting your\Nguard down so she can strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:08.36,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Well, you were originally \Na demon, too, Tontt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.94,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tontt's a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:15.89,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Yes. Tontt is the name of my many helpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,There's a lot of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.85,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Yes. The Tontts were \Ndemons who created toys
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:24.32,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,and caused mischief for \Nhumans in their attics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.22,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.62,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,On a very cold night long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:32.22,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,a Tontt was trying to steal some \Nfood and was found by a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:34.98,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,They escaped into the attic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:39.25,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,but became unable to move \Nfrom starvation and the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:40.49,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,That's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:46.75,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,The child who found the Tontt brought \Nthem some warm milk and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:49.48,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Then they snuggled up \Nin a blanket together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:54.25,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,It was a cold night, but they \Nwere able to sleep nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:59.00,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,That Tontt had a change of heart and \Nwondered if they could do something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:02.11,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,for that good child and \Nother good children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.64,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,And then... they became Santa Claus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They got big!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:11.14,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Which means when Tontts grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.32,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,They turn out like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:19.65,Default,MERRNYA,0,0,0,,Once they become Santa, \Nthey can create anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then there's a lot of Santa Clauses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:25.80,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:27.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:29.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are there Santas that look like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.50,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Oh, what a lovely drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:33.54,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,This one looks just like my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.39,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,He'll get mad at you for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:37.24,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Did you draw all of this, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope. Doux drew this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:43.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Den drew this one, and Sana drew this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:46.97,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Doux, you're a demon. Why are \Nyou doing that with humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:49.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Because we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.04,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:54.73,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.48,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Merryna and Tontt are also my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.62,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Really? That makes Santa so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:10.73,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Then if you meet another Santa or Tontt,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.21,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,be friends with them, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:13.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:18.41,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Okay, just three more \Npresents to hand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:21.73,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,To finish things off, let's see who can \Ndeliver theirs the fastest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:22.26,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.39,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:24.70,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.45,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,This is so childish...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:32.73,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,But what else can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:36.73,Default,DOUX/MERRYNA,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:40.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay! Mission complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:43.99,top,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Doux, thank you for helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:47.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, are you going home already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:52.24,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Yes. Before I go, why don't \NI grant your wish, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:57.25,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,I'm just supposed to do this for human \Nchildren, but let me grant you a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:58.73,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,What's your wish, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux's wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.01,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,I WANT TO HELP SANTA CLAUS\N-DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,already came true though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.51,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,So {\i1}that's{\i0} why you were awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.39,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:13.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Can we talk again sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:15.64,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sure we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.83,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Make sure you stay a good \Ngirl until then, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:22.78,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:30.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You met Santa Claus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:33.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup. She was a {\i1}lady{\i0} Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-How could I fall asleep \Nat a time like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We handed out presents together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We completed our mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:44.84,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,To think they actually existed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:46.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The world is bigger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:48.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,S-So where is this Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:50.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Did you capture her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:52.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope. She went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:57.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No... It's not "mission complete" \Nif you didn't capture her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But she gave me a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look! It's a big box!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:05.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wonder what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,All right, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.74,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now your trial is to capture Santa Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:22.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:25.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,One, two! Mission complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:32.53,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S FAMILIAR LOVES HUMANS TOO MUCH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:32.53,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Familiar \NLoves Humans Too Much!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.86,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,A wall in the mines collapsed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:39.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. Apparently, there are some \Nhuman casualties, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:40.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:42.94,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Er, this doesn't concern you, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:46.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,More importantly, it's dangerous \Nif you aren't being careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What were you supposed to do \Nwith your left hand again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh! Curl it up like a kitty paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:56.23,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's right, a kitty paw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:14:57.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.35,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:05.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Okay, now let's slowly cut that \Nwith the knife. Slowly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.80,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Be careful with that knife, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:12.72,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If you cut your hand, it's \Ngoing to be really ouchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:18.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:17.86,top,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.74,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're so overprotective!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:21.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hiyah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.67,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,No! You've got the wrong idea, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How do I have the wrong idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:29.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You are absolutely, positively \Noverprotectively showing her how to cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:33.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I figured this might happened, \Nso I declined at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:34.95,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:37.99,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:41.96,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,You and Big Sister Jahi \Nare busy with work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:48.39,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,So Doux wants to get really good \Nat cooking and make you yummy food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:52.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to decline \Nafter she says something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:55.70,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My precious daughter's \Nfirst homemade meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:58.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Please cut us a little slack, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:16:01.26,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I fear that it might be too late for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This does look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:11.45,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no. His Majesty is devastated
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:16.15,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,she didn't offer him\N her first homemade meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Say, "Aah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:24.62,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Should I eat this? Should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:27.09,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Which one is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:29.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You don't like sandwiches?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:32.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-No, I wouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:36.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Actually, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:40.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's prepare some food for \Nthe magical beasts, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:43.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,For the magical beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:46.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see. That's a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:49.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Then why don't you feed my familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:52.28,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It'd be perfect for that trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:54.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:59.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Giant rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A part of the wall collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:04.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Because of that, the \Nmining has been halted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Not to mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:09.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Human casualties like that also occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go rush off to treat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:16.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But they can't work if I don't heal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How do you always think like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:25.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Did you forget the three principles \Nto become a full-fledged demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:29.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Mushrooms, seal, and... chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:32.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must shrewdly \Noppress, steal, and kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:37.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons are supposed to \Nbe cruel and hurt humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:42.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And we aren't supposed to treat \Nhumans who are already injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're supposed to feed \Nthem to the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is Druj.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:50.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty's one and only familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:56.34,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Druj contributed greatly while His \NMajesty was trying to conquer the world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Druj proved most useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.11,0:18:02.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,when it came to getting rid of \Nthe defeated humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:10.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Druj reacts to human blood \Nand only eats the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,The wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:15.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. Meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:18.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We are going to feed that human to Druj.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:21.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That is your trial for today, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But Doux wants to help \Nthe humans' ouchies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:30.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So you're saying that you are going \Nto abandon Druj and help the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's not just Druj.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:36.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There are many who live \Nin the demon world:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:38.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,those who only eat meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:40.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,those who only eat fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:43.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and those who only consume eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:47.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They aren't picky eaters. \NThat is all they can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:51.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Druj does not recognize anything \Nother than the wounded as food
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and will throw anything else up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:58.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The more you treat humans, Lady Doux, \Nthe less Druj will have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:00.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And then Druj will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I don't want that to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Of course, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:06.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, bring that wounded human over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:09.83,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux is too kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.92,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,So I'll just have to take \Nadvantage of that kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.44,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons or humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:21.05,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,When faced with a situation where \Nshe can only save one or the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:23.83,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,even Lady Doux should be \Nable to abandon the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:25.85,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,That is what I've discovered this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:29.13,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to recreate \Nthis situation over and over
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:31.19,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,and if she gets used to abandoning them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:33.95,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,her attachment to the \Nhumans should disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:37.11,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is the first step towards that goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:38.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:40.57,Default,PRISONER CHILD A,0,0,0,,Wait, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:44.07,Default,PRISONER CHILD A,0,0,0,,My leg is hurt. It hurts so \Nbad that I can't stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, I can't take you if you can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:57.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you healing her?! I told \Nyou {\i1}not{\i0} to heal her, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:20:00.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I can't take her with \Nme if she can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:03.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then you need to make them walk \Neven if you have to drag them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's what demons do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:09.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But Doux isn't strong at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And my arms are all heavy, \Nso I can't drag her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:14.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your arms are heavy? Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:19.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,'Cause I got lots of \Nsandwiches in my pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:25.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Well, now what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:28.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Druj has nothing to eat and is angry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:45.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've got lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:47.77,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That won't work, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:51.77,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I told you this already. Druj \Nwill only eat wounded humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:20:58.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:20:59.77,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,OM NOM NOM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:05.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi! Druj said it was yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:10.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:13.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's... mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.79,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me Lady Doux used her
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:18.10,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,magical powers so Druj could eat it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:19.34,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:21.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,D-Decided what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:28.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to make yummy food \Nthat everyone can eat after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:33.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Demons, humans, magical \Nbeasts, and animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:39.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then they'll all tell me it's \Nyummy, and we can all eat together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:44.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:51.87,Default,BOY C,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:53.63,Default,GIRL F,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:55.50,Default,BOY E,0,0,0,,Druj is awesome, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:22:00.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:03.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I haven't the slightest...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Someone, please tell me.
